      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A city bike share charges a flat unlock fee and a per-minute rate, and the price of a ride of "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "t",
          "text": "t"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " minutes is a straight line that anyone can sketch on the back of a ticket."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The unlock costs $1, so a ride of "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "t",
          "text": "t"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " minutes costs "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "1 + 0.15\\,t",
          "text": "1 + 0.15\\,t"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " in total."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Riders who pay $ "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "p",
          "text": "p"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " per month for a pass and ride "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "n",
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " times pay "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "p / n",
          "text": "p / n"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " per ride, and the pass wins once "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "n",
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " is large enough."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A receipt filed under C:\\rides\\2024 keeps its backslashes, and a plain sum like $5 and $10 stays text."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "math",
      "tex": "\\text{price}(t) = 1 + 0.15\\,t",
      "text": "\\text{price}(t) = 1 + 0.15\\,t"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "With a monthly pass the per-minute rate drops to zero for the first thirty minutes, which changes the shape of the line for short rides."
        }
      ]
    }
